```console
$ scherzo-cloud workflow validate --help
Validate a local workflow definition

Usage: scherzo-cloud workflow validate [OPTIONS] --source-root <ROOT> <WORKFLOW_FILE>

Arguments:
  <WORKFLOW_FILE>  Workflow definition path, resolved from the initial working directory

Options:
      --source-root <ROOT>  Directory boundary for workflow source files
      --json                Print the validation result as JSON
  -h, --help                Print help

```
